        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<div style=\"background:#EFF6FF;border:2px solid #1D4ED8;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin:10px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#1D4ED8;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;\">Casus C02: 34-jarige administratief medewerker in de zorg</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#1E293B;\"><p>34-jarige administratief medewerker in de zorg; duur: 3 maanden. Recidiverende paniekepisoden, anticipatieangst, situationele vermijding en beroepsmatige interferentie. &nbsp;|&nbsp; Duur: 3 maanden</p></div></div><div style=\"background:#F8FAFC;border:1.5px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin:10px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#475569;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;\">21-daagse monitoring</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#1E293B;\"><p>Paniekepisoden: gem. 2,3/week. Vermijdingsepisodes: gem. 4,1/dag. Veiligheidsgedrag: gem. 8,7/dag. Geplande exposurepogingen: gem. 0,3/dag. Werkaanwezigheid: 60%. Verwachte angst in publieke settings: 7,8/10.</p></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:14px 0;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Tweedelig netwerk — C02\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:6px;\" /></div><div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:2px solid #047857;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin:10px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#047857;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;\">Beschikbare behandelingsopties (te rangschikken)</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#1E293B;\"><ul style=\"margin:4px 0;padding-left:22px;\"><li style=\"margin:3px 0;\"><strong>BO-1: Vermijdingsgedrag</strong></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0;\"><strong>BO-2: Veiligheidsgedrag</strong></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0;\"><strong>BO-3: Interoceptieve focus</strong></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0;\"><strong>BO-4: Geplande exposure</strong></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0;\"><strong>BO-5: Dagstructuur</strong></li></ul></div></div>",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID43"
      }
    },
